        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kūjūdegelekwa na Kaisali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbiza wingīla Fesito a ha nīmo gwa būsugi ū mu sī yenīyo; aho jabīta shikū idatū wīnga ī Kaisalia ūja Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji bataale na a batongeeji ba Bayudaya būūkansomboolela ī mihayo ya kūbūūlwa kwa ng'wa Paulo, nīyo būng'wikūmbīlīja ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balīnomba abīītīle shigongo; alagīle ize Yelusalemu, nguno baalī balomana kūng'wibandīīla na kūmūlagīla mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Fesito ūbashokeja gīkī, “Ū Paulo alī Kaisalia alang'hanilwe;” na gīkī ū wei ng'wenekīlī walī n'iganiko lya kūja ko ūlū jabīta shikū ngehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja kūhaya gīkī, “Bamò ba batongeeji bing'we ni bizage hamò nane bakīmīīle nang'hwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo, babooleche ū būkenaagūji bokwe”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akikala nabo shikū ja kūshika inaane nūūlū ikūmi gīko, hūna ūtulumenha ashokile Kaisalia; ha ntondo yaho wigasha kūlamula, ūlagīla witanwa ū Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika, a Bayudaya abo baalī biza kūfuma Yelusalemu, bandya kūsomboola mihayo mingī nīyo midito, ya kūmūūla; alīyo nahene būlemeelwa ū koolecha ū būng'hana wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būsombooji bokwe ū Paulo ūhaya gīkī, “Ū nene natīītile mhayo gose gose gwabūbi ū kū Bayudaya, nūūlū ū kū hekalu, nūūlū ni kūlī Kaisali dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Fesito akabona abayeje a Bayudaya, na lūūlū ūnshokeja ū Paulo alīng'wīla gīkī, “Hamo ūtogilwe kūja Yelusalemu nakīlamulīle kwene ī mihayo yako?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Paulo ūhaya, “A henaha nīmīīlaga kū būtongi w'ibanza lya ng'wa Kaisali, aho hanigeleelilwe kūlamulīlwa. Ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūmanile hape gīkī natabakenije mhayo nūūlū gūmò a Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ūlū nalī ng'hūbi nūūlū nīītile mhayo gwa kūningīja mu kūcha, natogohaga ū kūcha, alīyo ūlū gūtīho mhayo nūūlū gūmò ūyo balīnibūūla a banhū aba, atīho ūyo adūgije kūnitūūla mu makono gabo. Nalīlomba kūja kūlī Kaisali!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Fesito a henaho wandya kūlūngalūnga na a banhū b'ibanza; aho wamala ūshosha gīkī, “Ali lūūlū, īkī walomba kūja kūlī Kaisali, ūkūja ng'hana!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo kū būtongi bo ng'wa Agilipa na Belinike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū ndebe, ntemi Agilipa wiza ī Kaisalia hamò na Belinike, kwiza kūngīsha ū Fesito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamala ho shikū ningī, nose ū Fesito ūnsomboolela ū ntemi ī mihayo ya ng'wa Paulo; ūhaya gīkī, “Alīho munhū aha walekilwe na Feliki atungilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naalī naajile Yelusalemu būūkanisomboolela a bagabīji bataale na a banamhala ba Bayudaya, būnilomba nang'winhe nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nane nūbashokeja gīkī, shitī shīmīle sha Balumi kūlamula munhū ose ose aho ataalī kūmanhya nabo a babūūji bakwe būshū kū būshū, nang'hwe afunye būsombooji ū mu yose īyo balīmūūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū aho biza natadīlile; a ha ntondo yaho nigasha ng'wibanza, nūlagīla ū munhū ng'wenūyo wenhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayīmīīla kwandya kūmūūla a babūūji bakwe, nūgayiwa mo nūūlū gūmò ū gwabūbi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlū ītī ya wihalalīja wa mihayo ya dini yabo dūhū, na ya ng'wa munhū ūmò, Yesu, ūyo wamala kūcha; alīyo ū Paulo akūgaagaanaga kūhaya gīkī alīho mpanga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ī mihayo yenīyo īkanizwanja, nose nūmūja ūlū atogilwe kūja Yelusalemu īkalamulīlwe kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Paulo ūlomba kūjūlamulwa na Augusto, hūna nūlagīla alang'hanwe kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya kūntwala ū kūlī Kaisali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Agilipa ūng'wīla ū Fesito gīkī, “Ūkūbeelela nang'wigwe nane ū munhū ng'wenūyo.” Ū Fesito ūhaya, “Ntondo ūkūndegeleka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana aha ntondo yaho biza a ba Agilipa nū Balinike baamanukaga, baalī hamò na bataale ba bashilikale, pye na a banhū a bataale bataale a ba mu nzengo. Būshika bingīla ū ng'wibanza, hūna ū Fesito ūlagīla witanwa ū Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Fesito wandya kūhaya gīkī, “Ntemi Agilipa na a bing'we bababa pye abo mulī hamò nise aha, ū munhū ūyo mulīmona ng'wenūyū, pye a Bayudaya ba Yelusalemu na a ba henaha bakūnilīlīīlaga būhaya gīkī, shitigelile ikale mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nene natūgūbonaga ū mhayo ūyo wītile, ū gwa kūng'wenheleja kūcha; gwike īkī walombile kūja kūlī Augusto, naabonile īlī yawiza nantwale ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike natī nago gete ū mhayo gwa kapanga ūyo nalang'wandīkīle ū ntaale wane; h'ī nguno yene nang'wenha kū būtongi wing'we. Ū no no no ū kū būtongi wako ntemi Agilipa. Hamo ū mu kūmūja būja nakūpandīka sha kwandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nakūbiza giti nalī nchilū chilū ūlū nūtwala ntungwa alīyo natoolekegije ī ng'hana ya mihayo īyo alībūūlīlwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
